 decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DerivativeBasisSpreadOnVariableRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_uZY50WCisU6AQEZA079q0Q">4.25</ix:nonFraction>% per annum on the notional amount of the swap in exchange for the Borrower paying IDB <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="As_Of_10_19_2023_dei_LegalEntityAxis_xelb_IsraelDiscountBankOfNewYorkMember_us-gaap_FinancialInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_SwapMember_V9cXEb2Op0uzgAm7RFfyRA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DerivativeFixedInterestRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_jvyUolMGxk2JqnaemdmznA">9.46</ix:nonFraction>% per annum on such notional amount. The term and declining notional amount of the swap agreement was aligned with the amortization of the October 2023 term loan principal amount.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The October 2023 term loan was repaid in full as part of the December 12, 2024 debt issuance transaction described below, and the related swap agreement was terminated concurrent with the loan repayment. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">FEAC Term Loan Debt (December 12, 2024 through December 31, 2025)</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On December 12, 2024, the Company and certain of its subsidiaries entered into a new loan and security agreement with FEAC Agent, LLC, as administrative agent and collateral agent, FEF Distributors, LLC, as lead arranger, and Restore Capital, LLC (&#8220;Restore&#8221;), as agent for certain lenders, pursuant to which the lenders made term loans to the Company and agreed to make additional term loans to the Company upon the satisfaction of a condition precedent described in the loan agreement. The term loans under the loan agreement are as follows: (1) a term loan in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_y6pPMluFskOFXjmfaNU9sQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_RXsc3QgYRkmdNF5LAEnnrg">3.95</ix:nonFraction> million (&#8220;Term Loan A&#8221;) was made on the closing date, (2) a term loan in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_TtuwTxpN9UOgklNcr1J81Q" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_cGZTy48xVk2e0zgqTzYEjQ">4.0</ix:nonFraction> million (&#8220;Term Loan B&#8221;) was made on the closing date, and (3) a term loan in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_DelayedDrawTermLoanMember__ItydZjVjUel-P_BmznHbg" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_fCQ-oZGEQk2KZocVkQaoiw">2.05</ix:nonFraction> million (&#8220;Delayed Draw Term Loan&#8221;; Term Loan A, Term Loan B and Delayed Draw Term Loan are referred to as &#8220;Term Loans&#8221;) was subsequently made in March 2025. The proceeds from Term Loan A and Term Loan B were used to repay the remaining balance of the Company&#8217;s October 2023 term loan with IDB, as well as to pay fees, costs, and expenses incurred in connection with entering into the new loan agreement, and the balance may be used for working capital purposes. A portion of the proceeds from the Delayed Draw Term Loan were deposited in a bank account to satisfy a liquidity covenant in the loan agreement.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On April 21, 2025, the Company and certain of its subsidiaries and its lenders and FEAC Agent, LLC entered into an amendment of the December 12, 2024 loan and security agreement, which provided for a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_NewTermLoanDebtMember_-ulSwylLnEeolUZRCPkPUQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:LongTermDebtRepaymentToBeMade" scale="6" id="Narr_9GO5-mSn7UmehPnFKy10rA">1.5</ix:nonFraction> million repayment of the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_y6pPMluFskOFXjmfaNU9sQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_2vuuC0tGVUKuZKmtRbwV2Q">3.95</ix:nonFraction> million Term Loan A, and an additional Term Loan B in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_-INWgqPSm0ydaFG-Y_LjIg" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:DebtInstrumentAdditionalBorrowings" scale="6" id="Narr_otlx4fNssUiQSrFWnU_inQ">5.12</ix:nonFraction> million. The term loans outstanding after giving effect to the April 21, 2025 amendment and the application of the proceeds of the additional Term Loan B were as follows: (1) Term Loan A in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_oJfX0YcT20WCbpiyZ4pLuQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_PVqttqC9dU2APZoa5Kjqtg">4.50</ix:nonFraction> million, and (2) Term Loan B in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_-INWgqPSm0ydaFG-Y_LjIg" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_cHMxT6p0Ek-SyTvS1yMuOQ">9.12</ix:nonFraction> million. The proceeds from the additional Term Loan B were used to repay a portion of Term Loan A, as well as to pay fees, costs, and expenses incurred in connection with entering into the April 21, 2025 amendment, with the balance to be used for working capital purposes.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In connection with the April 21, 2025 amendment and refinancing transaction, UTG Capital, Inc., a Delaware corporation (UTG&#8221;), purchased a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_UtgCapitalIncMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xelb_DebtRefinancingApril2025Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_JrGM2Jyn20mliw1ubM37Vg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:DebtInstrumentParticipationInterest" scale="-2" id="Narr_OyUHIrdl70a1ACdVQSK76Q">100</ix:nonFraction>% undivided, participation interest in Term Loan B for a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_UtgCapitalIncMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xelb_DebtRefinancingApril2025Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_JrGM2Jyn20mliw1ubM37Vg" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_2IYmQgECSE6scOCkSCv2nQ">9.12</ix:nonFraction> million. Also in connection with the refinancing, the Company issued certain warrants to UTG and Restore, and amended certain warrants that had been previously issued on December 12, 2024 (see Note 7 for additional details).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On May 15, 2025, the Company repaid $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_5_15_2025_To_5_15_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_DdAgLpdOjEGT-IK5Co_frw" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfLongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_hvVkTvl-AU2pPufz-4dj6w">0.50</ix:nonFraction> million of the outstanding principal amount of Term Loan A.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On October 7, 2025, the Company and certain of its subsidiaries and its lenders and FEAC Agent, LLC entered into a further amendment of the December 12, 2024 loan and security agreement, pursuant to which (i) the agents and lenders (as defined in the loan and security agreement) consented to the transfer and the release of the agents&#8217; liens on the equity interests of IM Topco, LLC; (ii) the liquid asset covenant requirement was reduced to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_10_7_2025_To_10_7_2025_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_NewTermLoanDebtMember_AVRswccUIEupfsaEvL6heQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:ThresholdLiquidAssetCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_99NS9EjGskOhV-zMFdSoMw">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction>; and (iii) Xcel made a prepayment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_10_7_2025_To_10_7_2025_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_i0sbtkzjgE-UyGSFadCh-A" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfLongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_4vm6kte9g0eC8aqRLbMGCA">0.25</ix:nonFraction> million against the outstanding principal amount of Term Loan A, of which $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_10_7_2025_To_10_7_2025_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_i0sbtkzjgE-UyGSFadCh-A" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:PrepaymentOfDebtPaidOutOfBlockedAccount" scale="6" id="Narr_gUMHCEw_pUutSpR7xLDp3A">0.14</ix:nonFraction> million was paid from the blocked account. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On November 18, 2025, the Company and certain of its subsidiaries and its lenders and FEAC Agent, LLC entered into the fourth amendment of the December 12, 2024 loan and security agreement, pursuant to which (i) the agents and lenders (as defined in the loan and security agreement) provided the Company with a limited waiver with respect to certain specified events of default, and also amended certain financial covenants related to the term loan agreement; (ii) the Company committed to make a prepayment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_11_18_2025_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_rPW7bah0pEeHufwNH9VXoQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:DebtInstrumentPrepaymentObligation" scale="6" id="Narr_haXfXhpgz02mGxO8dKq8cw">3.25</ix:nonFraction> million on Term Loan A by February 20, 2026, along with the </p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">72</p></div></div>
