ditLlcMember_AEQ4f9M_LUa4RcrVgPTA2w" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_vIXKVS28x0exA7QhxU8fZQ">2.0</ix:nonFraction>% floor, plus (i) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_y6pPMluFskOFXjmfaNU9sQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DerivativeBasisSpreadOnVariableRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_BW6ZxyTqxE-5CPxd4pYD7g">8.5</ix:nonFraction>% for Term Loan A and <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_M-WTmja3FUGXEDfDxSd9zQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Delayed</span></span> Draw Term Loan and (ii) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_TtuwTxpN9UOgklNcr1J81Q" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DerivativeBasisSpreadOnVariableRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_MC83Jg2bqkWiGVtdovKdZw">13.5</ix:nonFraction>% for Term Loan B. From and after April 21, 2025, interest on the Term Loans accrues at an annual rate equal to the 3-month SOFR rate, subject to a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_EXfRJT6sUkmEeompsitlOA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Vq-xEbBY-UeQfGl2DmhxtQ">2.0</ix:nonFraction>% floor, plus (i) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_oJfX0YcT20WCbpiyZ4pLuQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DerivativeBasisSpreadOnVariableRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_EA2yNQ5XAUmkFALtMW3t_w">8.5</ix:nonFraction>% for Term Loan A and (ii) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_-INWgqPSm0ydaFG-Y_LjIg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DerivativeBasisSpreadOnVariableRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_cEF654sidEKeOGnunCQyIg">6.5</ix:nonFraction>% for Term Loan B.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Interest on amounts outstanding under the Term Loans accrues daily and is payable at the end of each calendar month, except that from April 21, 2025 through March 31, 2027, interest on the Term Loan B will be paid in-kind (&#8220;PIK&#8221;) by being capitalized and added to the principal amount of the Term Loan B at the end of each calendar month. For the Current Year, the Company recognized approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_xLDaje6a3EqUILcqWnocGA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaidInKindInterest" scale="6" id="Narr_LitqKsUanUuelWP4AoNNuA">0.71</ix:nonFraction> million of PIK interest, and the accumulated PIK interest at December 31, 2025 (reported within the carrying value of long-term debt on the consolidated balance sheet) was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_hin6VKrnPE6XXNbLFvgCOA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:LongTermDebtAccumulatedPaidInKindInterest" scale="6" id="Narr_IIMg_FrvBUyE352ILDT8zA">0.71</ix:nonFraction> million.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">73</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">XCEL BRANDS,&#160;INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes&#160;to Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_D6dWGF_SNk2YvZ989GqWsg_cont3" continuedAt="Tb_D6dWGF_SNk2YvZ989GqWsg_cont4"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">For the Current Year and Prior Year, the Company incurred interest expense related to term loan debt (including interest paid in cash, PIK, and the amortization of deferred finance costs) of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_NewTermLoanDebtMember_QkBX3fbEo0K4mC9MAd4ULQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseNonoperating" scale="6" id="Narr_zv9TunZ4oEqRqlzeXUe-MQ">2.08</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_NewTermLoanDebtMember_do46Lvj6cUWG3_-WbDSDrQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseNonoperating" scale="6" id="Narr_wONtD_XNUEWEO7dg4oJ_kw">0.62</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively, reflecting an effective interest rate of approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_NewTermLoanDebtMember_Ov97C2n4U066QsUNJw6oIQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_cpN49qhgmECyfrE24f1rVQ">15.0</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_NewTermLoanDebtMember_Drc-jKn6X0O70JMtB5H_Fw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Q27WOJRB3ke5y8R87DTKlg">11.9</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Exit Fees</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The amended loan agreement also requires that the Company pay an exit fee of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_uYwjhA1AlUqy9K0EehOBDw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFeeAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_7rDK0iqrjU-THKqNoFUBuA">0.175</ix:nonFraction> million to FEAC related to Term Loan A and an exit fee of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_RestoreCapitalLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_qFK9wCaKQkq5MZBVJCIh3w" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFeeAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_MiUBuWivQ02VcxMzylFFXQ">0.40</ix:nonFraction> million to Restore related to Term Loan B upon the maturity or full payment of the Term Loans. The Company is accruing the cost of the Term Loan A exit fee over the remaining term of the related debt, while the net present value of the Term Loan B exit fee on April 21, 2025 was recognized as part of the loss on early extinguishment of debt (as described below). As of December 31, 2025, the amount of accrued exit fees with respect to Term Loan A was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_rHBTv533qUCGrtvAyL5eDg" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:AccruedExitFeesCurrent" scale="6" id="Narr_s28vx5BJeE64Xl21Aw3paA">0.11</ix:nonFraction> million and is presented within Accounts payable, accrued expenses and other current liabilities on the consolidated balance sheet, while the amount of accrued exit fees with respect to Term Loan B was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_2XDyTwsQ4kGm99_wRFNjrg" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:AccruedExitFeesNoncurrent" scale="6" id="Narr_CGbD5Zp_Wk6miT3SFpPNsQ">0.29</ix:nonFraction> million and is presented within Other long-term liabilities on the consolidated balance sheet.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Deferred Finance Costs and Other Reductions to Carrying Value of Debt</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In connection with entering into the Term Loans in December 2024, the Company incurred loan origination fees, plus various legal and other fees; these fees and costs totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_NewTermLoanDebtMember_sO7zzCOq1kOBrSJ94XjSVA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredFinanceCostsGross" scale="6" id="Narr_rElOa2iDEU2cHuTuHzP3EA">0.92</ix:nonFraction> million were deferred on the Company&#8217;s balance sheet as a reduction of the carrying value of the term loan debt. Also in connection with entering into the Term Loans in December 2024, the Company issued certain warrants to the lenders to purchase shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. In accordance with applicable GAAP, the Company allocated the value of the total proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_NewTermLoanDebtMember_-9KUV6MTcUy3uObQ27PCjw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_qeyNdKxRe0mIZ32WNNh9pA">10.0</ix:nonFraction> million between the term loan debt and the warrants, based on the relative fair values of each; as a result, the Company recognized a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_12_12_2024_To_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_JWzy8RcwjEqoKcNCFP5Whw" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" scale="6" id="Narr_9cRAL17q4UuO6_mqvSl-OQ">0.48</ix:nonFraction> million increase to stockholders&#8217; equity as additional paid-in capital for the allocated fair value of the warrants, and an offsetting decrease to the net carrying value of the term loan debt. From December 12, 2024 through April 20, 2025, these reductions to the carrying value of the term loan debt totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_Iykqhv6zhUm7qoktfy-OPg" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfDebtDiscountPremium" scale="6" id="Narr_aN5illHnq0OXHa8c3qJ8lA">1.40</ix:nonFraction> million were being amortized to interest expense over the term of the debt using the effective interest method. The $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_4_21_2025_To_4_21_2025_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_NewTermLoanDebtMember_WmCVJpgp9kSWwIAJV_UhGw" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:WriteOffOfDeferredDebtIssuanceCost" scale="6" id="Narr_fkWUW091W0aLWgzAyVpOsA">1.26</ix:nonFraction> million remaining unamortized balance of such amounts was written-off as part of the loss on early extinguishment of debt upon the closing of the April 21, 2025 debt refinancing.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">In connection with the debt refinancing transaction on April 21, 2025 as described above, the Company incurred certain legal costs and other fees; these fees and costs totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_NewTermLoanDebtMember_-ulSwylLnEeolUZRCPkPUQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredFinanceCostsGross" scale="6" id="Narr_sn9zr0C1tUS-iUUPhOX84g">0.53</ix:nonFraction> million were deferred on the Company&#8217;s balance sheet as a reduction of the carrying value of the term loan debt. Also in connection with the April 21, 2025 debt refinancing transaction, the Company issued certain warrants to UTG to purchase shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. In accordance with GAAP, the Company allocated the value of the total proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xelb_NewLoanAndSecurityAgreementMember_t1QBX2TYrkugAbevYYcXaA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_Pd9ifC3FsUeJvKL_XFEkzQ">13.62</ix:nonFraction> million between the term loan debt and the warrants, based on the relative fair values of each; as a result, the Company recognized a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_4_21_2025_To_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_f1yzaJaFA0uKz_rHqkLhzA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" scale="6" id="Narr_fxh281Nou0OQFKJwwhHClg">0.58</ix:nonFraction> million increase to stockholders&#8217; equity as additional paid-in capital for the allocated fair value of the warrants, and an offsetting decrease to the net carrying value of the term loan debt. These reductions to the carrying value of the term loan debt totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" cont