ction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_12_18_2025_To_12_18_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xelb_PrivateInvestmentInPublicEquityTransactionMember_q4jferQJsUWSiWjpcXi15w" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:ProceedsFromPrivateInvestmentInPublicEquityTransactionNetOfTransactionCosts" scale="6" id="Narr_MqhVIXDWnk6nSPf22TEW4A">1.82</ix:nonFraction> million. The Company intends to use the net proceeds from this transaction for working capital and general corporate purposes. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Pursuant to a placement agency agreement dated December 17, 2025, by and between the Company and Wellington Shields &amp; Co. LLC (the &#8220;PIPE Placement Agent&#8221;), the PIPE Placement Agent served as the exclusive placement agent in connection with this transaction. Upon the closing of this transaction, the Company issued the PIPE Placement Agent certain warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="Duration_12_17_2025_To_12_17_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_PlacementAgentMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xelb_PrivateInvestmentInPublicEquityTransactionMember_nE8_EXA-DUK-YRfr3-zPZw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:ClassOfWarrantOrRightsIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_lgIw9u9G7kSngPnVMrIXYg">66,802</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock, which are exercisable at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_JH3LV_Tylk-VFDaz510hgA" contextRef="As_Of_12_17_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_PlacementAgentMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xelb_PrivateInvestmentInPublicEquityTransactionMember_l6pZWkSRl0OjwWgk8UD_-A" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" na