sidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xelb_PublicOfferingMember_fhVZngkmBEuPprHxeWdB3Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_wcgB8AK7aE2OGAH9pm6HyQ">6.50</ix:nonFraction> per share.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The closing of the 2024 Offering occurred on March 19, 2024. The net proceeds to the Company from the sale of the shares, after deducting the underwriting discounts and commissions and other estimated offering expenses payable by the Company, were approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_3_19_2024_To_3_19_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xelb_PublicOfferingMember_x4erCJIeUE6rijwPRJEeWQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" scale="6" id="Narr_XhuQa2owMU6XLaJI0jYt3w">1.7</ix:nonFraction> million.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">In connection with the 2024 Offering, on March 14, 2024, the Company entered into subscription agreements with each of Robert W. D&#8217;Loren, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of the Company; Mark DiSanto, a director of the Company; and Seth Burroughs, Executive Vice President of Business Development and Treasury of the Company to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="As_Of_3_14_2024_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_Eisek32a0EWMk8X3yca2GQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_5WAMT5JfYEu8Ts_2I1D7Bw">13,258</ix:nonFraction>, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="As_Of_3_14_2024_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_srt_DirectorMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_xS5DJCcb9kych8xw0MGePA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_ZDP9qJMQ30Oci5zOadMgRg">13,258</ix:nonFraction>, and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="As_Of_3_14_2024_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_srt_ExecutiveVicePresidentMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_9pTBZnyp4UGEpQ-1WR9Pvw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_lU9KTqTvAUeQPihT0RiTJA">2,946</ix:nonFraction> shares, respectively, at a price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_JH3LV_Tylk-VFDaz510hgA" contextRef="As_Of_3_14_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_Te4lH_Md20SvDvB2PGU0Vw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_uTFbsVKJx0OCKJ7IgSdFcA">9.80</ix:nonFraction> per share. The total number of shares purchased was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="As_Of_3_14_2024_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_xelb_AgreementsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_hwUhNCEWdkaP5TZVjBX65A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_Y8YY0wYE1Uu_R40_2067Yw">29,462</ix:nonFraction>. Net proceeds after payment of agent fees were approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_3_14_2024_To_3_14_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember__yhI8S0Pe0aoY3LQTfZF6g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPrivatePlacement" scale="6" id="Narr_aDznu4om9UW48SBdMRIMKw">0.3</ix:nonFraction> million. The purchase of such shares closed concurrently with the 2024 Offering.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The aggregate number of shares of common stock issued in the 2024 Public Offering and Private Placement Transactions was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="Duration_3_15_2024_To_3_15_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xelb_PublicOfferingAndPrivatePlacementMember_dDrQa6x9u0Gfpj78JBWODA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_Nsm-zxO420ajy4fHtAnsGA">357,889</ix:nonFraction> shares and the total net proceeds received were approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_3_15_2024_To_3_15_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xelb_PublicOfferingAndPrivatePlacementMember_dDrQa6x9u0Gfpj78JBWODA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOrSaleOfEquity" scale="6" id="Narr_t4h4fJ5O00qMHMVKmeM3HQ">1.9</ix:nonFraction> million. Upon the closing of these </p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">76</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">XCEL BRANDS,&#160;INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes&#160;to Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_6b63345f_2539_4ffd_a74d_969f5a2f86cd"></a><a id="Tc_PHlKL2sh_0mJ6U8hX4IHiQ_1_7"></a><a id="Tc_k5SWSoBkC0aar0sWRK6TKQ_2_7"></a><a id="Tc_V1jlZiUT_U-gaJpJB_oZnA_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_o1mcjwlfak2ZEVDcV8V9ag_3_7"></a><a id="Tc_Q26BjcMsiUWi6NUWzNBfiQ_4_4"></a><a id="Tc_StIfi2DIQk2YjGerr04hHw_4_7"></a><a id="Tc_9HmzNZAFIEyfOlnmXNhY4w_4_9"></a><a id="Tc_wQ11YHkuPESuOBOmnWQR6w_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_Mz_AVRRDHkGnqW3DwIeG6Q_5_4"></a><a id="Tc_Au50cNKq6kagkgCrpL-cSg_5_7"></a><a id="Tc_POoehgLPykeG-MSX_LBWQg_5_9"></a><a id="Tc_CCop7-kNiEa3W5o4G8oIHQ_6_2"></a><a id="Tc_XQ0p7crD90GLdVU9GbZCzQ_6_4"></a><a id="Tc_wdiy3pwIoUqVF7EEgxnisA_6_7"></a><a id="Tc_hRYDFMA_q0KLcSK0eLD8gg_6_9"></a><a id="Tc_gQ3ELm6QWUKu7xksyE1V5Q_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_lV8i5dPPIkWXuBPqblsE4A_7_4"></a><a id="Tc_lTwrGM8PQ02bPKeG7ICGqg_7_9"></a><a id="Tc_hY9qf6dWfEauvZkl9Vfafg_7_10"></a><a id="Tc_jYFP0zBhNEa0wlq5TevcQQ_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_raXE-TBD8ECKjTjok-tN9w_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_Zt9bp5R7mkax-GdRNdUA0w_9_2"></a><a id="Tc_FeXxukJAb0e90V3WitBMQg_9_5"></a><a id="Tc_aqDWO3LiUUmREejvfjNB1A_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_I7yAs3HNJEq28Q5HDkZDUg_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_gBZe9yyi5UWTMqpEweuVaA_11_4"></a><a id="Tc_Yp4X7BaDMUO1I9Ips9uW_A_11_9"></a><a id="Tc_ekSolYZW7EWP4854bE0H0A_11_10"></a><a id="Tc_QP-UqZZbykOJZ31qRuXQzQ_12_0"></a><a id="Tc_ZKr6eCOAHk6RpljO9GQyvw_12_4"></a><a id="Tc_1GCdEbNjzEOUEVTGkmZVPg_12_9"></a><a id="Tc_FICdPMx50k2yJE7x3qcNgw_12_10"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_2Zu6TXG1zkWk-vv_oIyyoQ_cont2" continuedAt="Tb_2Zu6TXG1zkWk-vv_oIyyoQ_cont3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">transactions, the Company issued the Representative certain warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="As_Of_3_19_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_PlacementAgentMember_O3Gdx1zk9Uu8IieUjVpJSg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_4cVkcCH410WbkMaW0xrSLw">18,293</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock. Such warrants are exercisable at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_JH3LV_Tylk-VFDaz510hgA" contextRef="As_Of_3_19_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_PlacementAgentMember_O3Gdx1zk9Uu8IieUjVpJSg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_inpGPgnnk0e-hvzi3Ann3g">8.125</ix:nonFraction> per share, in whole or in part, during the <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_XxheCRnTJEOfYIFWSLujLw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">four and one-half year</span></span> period that commenced 180 days after March 15, 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Equity Incentive Plans</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company&#8217;s 2021 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2021 Plan&#8221;) is designed and utilized to enable the Company to provide its employees, officers, directors, consultants, and others whose past, present, and/or potential contributions to the Company have been, are, or will be important to the success of the Company, an opportunity to acquire a proprietary interest in the Company. Originally, a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="As_Of_12_30_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xelb_EquityIncentivePlan2021Member_wCOStIS_5UKgWAU2eTAXSA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_oGTj8TKgbE-u_gk9aCE3yg">400,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock were eligible for issuance under the 2021 Plan; during the Current Year, the Company&#8217;s stockholders approved amendment to the 2021 Plan that increased the number of shares authorized from <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="As_Of_12_30_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xelb_EquityIncentivePlan2021Member_wCOStIS_5UKgWAU2eTAXSA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_QXw8h9_LlkSm9HKZ166s7Q">400,000</ix:nonFraction> to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xelb_EquityIncentivePlan2021Member_-XoCBZ6m30ekKqdXYGEVcQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_NTbty8_3DkqEQ04G7xPcPA">1,150,000</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The 2021 Plan provides for the grant of any or all of the following types of awards: stock options (incentive or non-qualified), restricted stock, restricted stock units, performance awards, or cash awards. The 2021 Plan is administered by the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors, or, at the Board&#8217;s discretion, a committee of the Board.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In addition, stock-based awards (including options, warrants, and restricted stock) previously granted under the Company&#8217;s 2011 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2011 Plan&#8221;) remain outstanding and shares of common stock may be issued to satisfy options or warrants previously granted under the 2011 Plan, although <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xelb_EquityIncentivePlan2011Member_4UYYIx085ESJw0WOut_xeA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" id="Narr_z51xp_6UkUWFkkvaQH0rtA">no</ix:nonFraction> new awards may be granted under the 2011 Plan.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Stock-Based Compensation   </span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Total expense recognized for all forms of stock-based compensation was appro