Kf71bQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:AdvancesForRefinancing" scale="0" id="Narr_CLcFP6l4m0WGf-WxurnSDA">250,000</ix:nonFraction> advance to one of the Company&#8217;s subsidiaries, of which $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_12_12_2024_To_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_IpxCapitalLlcMember_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_tKp-4GOK7EmDt1_LoK0grw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:AdvancesRepaid" scale="0" id="Narr_VO3zGhTK3k-FNcnLmUHkgg">200,000</ix:nonFraction> was repaid to IPX upon the closing of the debt refinancing transaction. Additionally, IPX purchased a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_IpxCapitalLlcMember_IBgETM3MoEiftyU9q3cnVw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:DebtInstrumentParticipationInterest" scale="-2" id="Narr_zA-Pcu0QykGIB0PDB-hnnA">12.5</ix:nonFraction>% undivided, last-out, subordinated participation interest in a portion of the new term loan debt for a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_IpxCapitalLlcMember_IBgETM3MoEiftyU9q3cnVw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_x9d4yGHxp0W5DSuR1FSgTQ">500,000</ix:nonFraction>, and received a pro rata share of warrants received by the Term B Lenders to purchase shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">In connection with the April 2025 refinancing of the Company&#8217;s term loan debt (see Note 6 for additional details), IPX&#8217;s participation in Term Loan B was repaid and IPX purchased a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_30_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_IpxCapitalLlcMember_xelb_TermLoansAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_Wi12apvrT0iz1WkRpA_BjQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_kdcuOFxE3E-jMX7h1TA63w">500,000</ix:nonFraction> undivided, last-out, subordinated participation interest in Term Loan A.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Guarantee</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Since October 2024, in connection with a required increase to a standby letter of credit associated with the Company&#8217;s real estate lease for offices located at 1333 Broadway (see Note 9), Mr. D&#8217;Loren has provided a personal guarantee to the financial institution providing such letter of credit, in order to satisfy a portion of the associated collateral requirements for the letter of credit.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_xLDaje6a3EqUILcqWnocGA" name="us-gaap:SubsequentEventsTextBlock" id="Tb_hrT_T3BJMUuGTThjyYbU6A" continuedAt="Tb_hrT_T3BJMUuGTThjyYbU6A_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:21.6pt;"><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">12.</b></span>Subsequent Events</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Shares Issued to Chief Executive Officer</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In accordance with the terms of the amended employment agreement with Mr. D&#8217;Loren (see Note 7 for details), the Company issued the following shares of common stock to Mr. D&#8217;Loren: <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="Duration_1_2_2026_To_1_2_2026_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_03iS_JdDVku7Bg9SwYQTLg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_qtN44GJrGU2GbC_8_X2pGw">13,058</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock on January 2, 2026, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="Duration_2_2_2026_To_2_2_2026_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_bbvIQuigW0i_tXmmeqJEuQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_tcoqJCxmTUet0iVEsZzGnQ">9,771</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock on February 2, 2026, and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="Duration_2_27_2026_To_2_27_2026_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_NeTRg_m1nU-Z15UyzGNdZA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_H3xW8bg-TEWx625mOh_qGQ">9,906</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock on February 27, 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Executive Stock Option Cancellation</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="background:#ffffff;">Effective January 21, 2026, certain stock options originally issued in 2019 to Messrs D&#8217;Loren, Haran, and Burroughs to purchase an aggregate of </span><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="Duration_1_21_2026_To_1_21_2026_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_xelb_ChiefExecutiveOfficerAndExecutiveVicePresidentMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_9ytXa98Op0iGI0rOJfe5LA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsForfeituresInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_0GqBfdPJBUG_xmlfuIbbzQ">350,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> shares of common stock, were cancelled through mutual agreement between the Company and the respective executives. </span><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="Duration_1_21_2026_To_1_21_2026_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_xelb_ChiefExecutiveOfficerAndExecutiveVicePresidentMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_9ytXa98Op0iGI0rOJfe5LA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_uS2wN5Q2CU6SPYcRzF-H-Q">None</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> of these options had vested, and </span><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_1_21_2026_To_1_21_2026_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_xelb_ChiefExecutiveOfficerAndExecutiveVicePresidentMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_9ytXa98Op0iGI0rOJfe5LA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_QVwq_UgipUS7_265_HQ9zQ">no</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> compensation was paid to the executives in exchange for such cancellation.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">January 2026 Equity Line Facility</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January 21, 2026, the Company entered into a common stock purchase agreement with White Lion Capital, LLC (&#8220;White Lion&#8221;), pursuant to which White Lion has committed to purchase up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_1_21_2026_To_1_21_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_WhiteLionCapitalLlcMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_e7Ut-AsZ0UWLWcPD1fPAsQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:CommonStockPurchaseCommitmentAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_Hm--zVsAHU2tGojyaXQ-lg">15.0</ix:nonFraction> million of the Company&#8217;s common stock. Under the terms and conditions of this agreement, the Company has the right, but not the obligation, to sell to White Lion, and White Lion is obligated to purchase, up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_1_21_2026_To_1_21_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_WhiteLionCapitalLlcMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_e7Ut-AsZ0UWLWcPD1fPAsQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:CommonStockPurchaseCommitmentAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_DqZGUAcM00K6JZTqQ9pymA">15.0</ix:nonFraction> million of the Company&#8217;s common stock. The actual amount and timing of any sales of Common Stock will be determined by the Company at its discretion. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The aggregate number of shares that the Company can sell White Lion under this agreement is limited to and may not exceed <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_prl09U-R0E2XnR3uIo925w" contextRef="Duration_1_21_2026_To_1_21_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_WhiteLionCapitalLlcMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_e7Ut-AsZ0UWLWcPD1fPAsQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:MaximumSharesIssuableUnderEquityLine" scale="0" id="Narr_AA_LxJy8yEGAj7YlJar5-w">1,178,173</ix:nonFraction> shares (subject to adjustment for any reorganization, recapitalization, non-cash dividend, stock split, reverse stock split, or other similar transaction), which is equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="Duration_1_21_2026_To_1_21_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_WhiteLionCapitalLlcMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_e7Ut-AsZ0UWLWcPD1fPAsQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:PercentageOfEquitySecuritiesIssuedOrIssuable" scale="-2" id="Narr_KI5LJkIZyU21HWslBDEAnQ">19.99</ix:nonFraction>% of the total shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock outstanding immediately prior to the execution of the agreement, unless (i) the Company obtains stockholder </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">90</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">XCEL BRANDS,&#160;INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes&#160;to Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_hrT_T3BJMUuGTThjyYbU6A_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_hrT_T3BJMUuGTThjyYbU6A_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">approval to issue additional shares in excess of this amount, or (ii) the average price paid for all shares of Common Stock issued under the agreement equals or exceeds certain levels as specified in the agreement. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In consideration for White Lion&#8217;s execution and entry into such arrangement, the Company agreed to issue White Lion $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="Duration_1_21_2026_To_1_21_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_WhiteLionCapitalLlcMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_e7Ut-AsZ0UWLWcPD1fPAsQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:CommonStockIssuedAsCommitmentFee" scale="0" id="Narr_G8jLxgAAmU6_miE9-iBt2w">37,500</ix:nonFraction> worth of common stock, with the number of shares issued determined based on the closing price of the Company&#8217;s stock on the business day immediately preceding the day on which the related registration statement is declared effective by the SEC. Additionally, pursuant to the terms of an advisory agreement between the Company and Maxim Group LLC, the Company agreed to pay Maxim Group LLC a cash fee equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="Duration_1_21_2026_To_1_21_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_WhiteLionCapitalLlcMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_e7Ut-AsZ0UWLWcPD1fPAsQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:EquityIssuanceFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_fBj7ctzLi0uL33R8nNVn5Q">4.0</ix:nonFraction>% of the gross proceeds received from any sales of securities to White Lion under this arrangement.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Debt Amendments and Refinancing</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On February 20, 2026 and March 20, 2026, the Company entered into the fifth and sixth amendments to the loan and security agreement with the term loan debt lenders and FEAC Agent, LLC. Pursuant to such amendments, (i) the Company prepaid $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_2_20_2026_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_LxhAG7xGk06EOCieEBFPqg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:DebtInstrumentPrepaymentObligation" scale="0" id="Narr_NnqlniRnbkWORFWINf1Jiw">500,000</ix:nonFraction> on Term Loan A (paid from the Blocked Account, as defined in the loan and security agreement) in connection with the fifth amendment and irrevocably authorized FAEC Agent, LLC, as the administrative agent to transfer up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_2_20_2026_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_LxhAG7xGk06EOCieEBFPqg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCollateralAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_Fkozg2zbK0aFKiHBA9aaUQ">500,000</ix:nonFraction> (the &#8220;Sixth Amendment Cash Collateral&#8221;) from the Blocked Account to an account maintained by the Administrative Agent to be held as cash collateral securing the Obligations (as defined in the loan and security agreement); (ii) the Company irrevocably authorized the administrative agent to: (a) apply all or any portion of the Sixth Amendment Cash Collateral to repay the Term Loan A, or (b) return all or any portion of the Sixth Amendment Cash Collateral to the Company, in each case at the lenders&#8217; sole discretion; (iii) the liquid asset covenant requirement was reduced to: (a) at all times prior to the repayment in full of the First Out Obligations (as defined in the loan and security agreement), $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_2_20_2026_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_LxhAG7xGk06EOCieEBFPqg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_zz8PEG9U0E-_A20wVlH_XA">500,000</ix:nonFraction> minus that amount of Sixth Amendment Cash Collateral used to repay Term Loan A, and (b) at all times after the repayment in full of the First Out Obligations, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_2_20_2026_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_LxhAG7xGk06EOCieEBFPqg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:DebtInstrumentAmountReducedTo" scale="0" id="Narr_KVOdKPmSskeodi9LQ08llw">0</ix:nonFraction>; and (iv) the transaction closing date was extended to March 24, 2026. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On April 13, 2026, the Company entered into the seventh amendment to the loan and security agreement with the term loan debt lenders and FEAC Agent, LLC, which provided for, among other things: the ability of the Company to consummate the issuance of certain senior secured notes (as described below); the ability for IPX to convert its $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_13_2026_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_QrbvglrWgkCbWqVZgOipDg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_kEE4-Qy__EWex11C821PUg">500,000</ix:nonFraction> Term Loan A to common shares of the Company at the price per share equal to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_JH3LV_Tylk-VFDaz510hgA" contextRef="As_Of_4_13_2026_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_QrbvglrWgkCbWqVZgOipDg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_r0shVZe4CEy-z7i_r50usg">1.435</ix:nonFraction>, subject to adjustment; modifications to certain payment terms; modifications to certain financial covenants; modifications to certain financial reporting requirements; and the amendment of the FEAC Agent, LLC&#8217;s role to include certain limitations. In connection with the seventh amendment, FEAC Agent LLC&#8217;s affiliated lenders entered into agreements whereby a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_13_2026_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_QrbvglrWgkCbWqVZgOipDg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_aGdO1U5gXES0g_anvTLVCQ">500,000</ix:nonFraction> portion of Term Loan A was sold and assigned to IPX, and the entirety of Term Loan B was sold and assigned to UTG. Additionally, the Company was relieved of its obligation to pay the remaining $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_13_2026_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_QrbvglrWgkCbWqVZgOipDg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFeeAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_OqoK41t9O0eLsijlEI3ngg">325,000</ix:nonFraction> amendment fee as specified in the fourth amendment.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Also on April 13, 2026, the Company entered into certain agreements with Smithline Family Trust II (&#8220;SFT&#8221;), Quick Capital, LLC (&#8220;Quick&#8221;), and IPX (collectively, the &#8220;Purchasers&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company issued and sold to the Purchasers <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="As_Of_4_13_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_PurchasersMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_SeniorNotesMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_lwApFFvSSUmME_R6NO0jEw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_