rmat="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPayment" scale="0" id="Narr_zg4DV0kXRkGmMo8ukvGltg">100,000</ix:nonFraction> monthly payments on the Secured Notes commencing October 13, 2026, with the balance due at maturity. The Company&#8217;s obligations under the Secured Notes are guaranteed by certain direct and indirect subsidiaries of the Company pursuant to a subsidiary guarantee, and are secured by the assets of the Company and the subsidiary guarantors pursuant to a security agreement. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">At any time after the occurrence of an event of default under the Secured Notes and for so long as such event of default is continuing, the Secured Notes are convertible into shares of common stock of the Company (i) initially at a fixed conversion price equal to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_JH3LV_Tylk-VFDaz510hgA" contextRef="As_Of_4_13_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_PurchasersMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_SeniorNotesMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_lwApFFvSSUmME_R6NO0jEw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" scale="0" id="Narr_sUfwjods6kyiqxVpu3SK4g">1.165</ix:nonFraction> per share and (ii) after May 17, 2026, at a price equal to the lesser of (a) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="Duration_5_17_2026_To_5_17_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_PurchasersMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_SeniorNotesMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_1600n-Xg5kud7r4uQpSwEg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRatio1" scale="0" id="Narr_i8Zu9Gc_8k6Rk123dX6H5w">85</ix:nonFraction>% multiplied by the lowest volume weighted average price of the common stock during the 10-trading day period prior to conversion and (b) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_JH3LV_Tylk-VFDaz510hgA" contextRef="As_Of_5_17_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_PurchasersMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_SeniorNotesMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_DfRys6Rm1kWM2zrTPyOzoQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" scale="0" id="Narr_3YaMk_80F0y2KEVTaIq8xQ">1.165</ix:nonFraction>. &#160;In addition, to the extent that Company is listed on the Nasdaq Capital Market, the aggregate number of </p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">91</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">XCEL BRANDS,&#160;INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes&#160;to Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_hrT_T3BJMUuGTThjyYbU6A_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">shares of common stock issuable to the Purchasers and any subsequent holder of the Secured Note shall not exceed <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_oi117mk2RU2JajuxvTP2NA" contextRef="Duration_4_13_2026_To_4_13_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_PurchasersMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_SeniorNotesMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_1a1U_-A2qEGu_6eiCiqO6g" decimals="1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:MaximumSharesHoldablePercentage" scale="0" id="Narr_axYJJ_DHK0OiwKsg43KxPA">19.9</ix:nonFraction>% of the total number of shares of common stock outstanding or of the voting power of the common stock as of April 13, 2026 less the shares issued pursuant to the securities purchase agreement unless the Company has obtained stockholder approval in compliance with Nasdaq Listing Rule 5635(d) to authorize the issuance of shares of common stock in connection with the conversion or exchange of all Secured Notes.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Company granted the Purchasers certain piggyback registration rights with respect to the shares of common stock issuable upon conversion of the Secured Notes.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Fees incurred in connection with the transactions described above were approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_13_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_PurchasersMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_SeniorNotesMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_lwApFFvSSUmME_R6NO0jEw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFeeAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_NAS9ZXyujk-usCPC_MLE2Q">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">As part of the transactions described above, IPX purchased $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_y9EXRe8KL0q_GXXbhqC2Yg" contextRef="As_Of_4_13_2026_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_IpxCapitalLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_SeniorNotesMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaa